  "body": {
    "content": [
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Bánh mì is a crisp baguette sandwich loaded with pork, pickled vegetables, and fresh herbs. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "The secret is the contrast: crispy bread, tender meat, tangy pickles, and cooling herbs all in one bite. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "This recipe makes 4 sandwiches.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Make the ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "do chua ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "do-chua"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "at least an hour before you plan to eat. The pickles need time to soften and absorb the brine.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
